        "heading": "Technician access and abuse prevention",
        "id": "",
        "text": "Technician access presets and abuse prevention Added in v0.23. Technician assignments (technicians.md) say where someone may work. Presets say what they may do there, as three shipped tiers an MSP can clone and tighten. Around them sit the safeguards that apply to everyone, Platform Admins included: protected device classes, fleet abuse limits, and independent review of anything that widens trust. Everything here lives at Settings → Security → Technician Access . The Security Features catalog ( Admin → Security → Security features ) lists every safeguard with its scope, whether this build actually enforces it, and the test that proves it."
